{
    "name": "synthetic-video-succeeded",
    "description": "SYNTHETIC (no Model Studio key was available to record): the canonical Wan video chain — submit parks RUNNING with the task id, one RUNNING tick, then the terminal poll carrying output.video_url and the usage block DashScope documents on success (duration 5 = output 5 + input 0). Shapes follow the live API reference pages (2026-09-16); the task id, timestamps and result URL are placeholders. {{request.url}} / {{request.origin}} bind per endpoint, so one chain serves all six video models — the second count is the same for each and only the RATE differs.",
